1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:02,396
(Bernadette:)My dad's pretty insistent on it,
though.

2
00:00:02,602 --> 00:00:04,522
Why don't I talk to your dad?

3
00:00:04,729 --> 00:00:06,689
- Man to man.
- Really?

4
00:00:06,898 --> 00:00:09,898
- Oh, that'd be so great. Heh.
- Done.

5
00:00:11,277 --> 00:00:15,027
I should probably give you a heads up
about a couple things.

6
00:00:15,239 --> 00:00:19,659
(Bernadette:)Even though he's retired from
the police force, he still carries his gun.

7
00:00:20,203 --> 00:00:23,703
(Bernadette:)But don't worry, he won't shoot it.
It's more of a fashion statement.

8
00:00:25,166 --> 00:00:26,916
Okay, heh.

9
00:00:27,126 --> 00:00:29,376
(Bernadette:)And just to be safe,
when you talk to him...

10
00:00:29,587 --> 00:00:32,047
(Bernadette:)...don't bring up Jimmy Carter,
gardeners...

11
00:00:32,256 --> 00:00:35,546
(Bernadette:)...foreign people, homosexuals,
Sean Penn, Vatican ll, gun controI...

12
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,890
(Bernadette:)...organic food,
the designated hitter rule...

13
00:00:38,095 --> 00:00:40,475
(Bernadette:)...recycling
or the fact that you're Jewish.

14
00:00:43,476 --> 00:00:47,436
(Howard:)Got it, got it.
Will you e-mail me that list, heh?

15
00:00:48,648 --> 00:00:52,278
(Bernadette:)So the thing to watch for,
if he's shouting at you, you're okay.

16
00:00:52,485 --> 00:00:54,275
(Bernadette:)But if he starts to get real quiet...

17
00:00:54,487 --> 00:00:58,197
(Bernadette:)...leave as quickly as you can
without making eye contact.

18
00:00:59,116 --> 00:01:02,786
(Bernadette:)Not in a straight line,
throw some zigs and zags in there.

19
00:01:05,456 --> 00:01:07,246
(Howard:)You know, this isn't that pressing.

20
00:01:07,458 --> 00:01:09,838
(Howard:)Why don't I talk to him about it
in May, heh?

21
00:01:10,044 --> 00:01:13,584
(Bernadette:)In May you're gonna be on
the International Space Station.

22
00:01:13,839 --> 00:01:15,759
They got a phone.

